  "description": "Extensions for Gridify providing streamlined filtering, ordering, pagination, aggregation, and cursor-based queries for Entity Framework Core in .NET 8+. Includes support for encrypted columns, custom converters, dynamic property mapping, and bitwise flag operators. Reduces boilerplate and improves developer productivity.",
